        </style><div xmlns="" class="content_block"><h2 class="auth__title">Топ-25 рекомендаций, которые нужны каждому бухгалтеру</h2><div class="doc-snippet"><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/dfas5suiur/" data-dfa="dfas5suiur"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/bssPhr2/"></a>Когда работа в бухгалтерском учете выстроена&nbsp;правильно документы не теряются, расчеты сходятся, а отчетность формируется без лишнего стресса.&nbsp;В материале Системы Главбух собраны 20 рекомендаций, которые помогут выстроить учет правильно, удобно и без перегрузки – от базовых настроек до ежедневной работы. </div><div id="documentBody" class="content-common"><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/tit1/" data-role="toc-anchor" class="toc-anchor"></a><h2 class="main__title-section title toc" toc-anchor="tit1"><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/bssPhr3/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/dfasr6zxhn/" data-dfa="dfasr6zxhn"></a>Организация бухгалерского учета&nbsp;</h2><div class="doc-columns doc-columns_type_lead"><table style="width:92%"><tr><td width="10%"><span class="media" style="display:block;width:80px;height:80px;"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/285314/" style="width:"></span></td><td width="90%"><a class="doc-columns__item-title link" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a><div class="doc-columns__item-text"></div></td></tr><tr><td width="10%"><span class="media" style="display:block;width:80px;height:80px;"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/285304/" style="width:"></span></td><td width="90%"><a class="doc-columns__item-title link" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a><div class="doc-columns__item-text"></div></td></tr><tr><td width="10%"><span class="media" style="display:block;width:80px;height:80px;"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/285305/" style="width:"></span></td><td width="90%"><a class="doc-columns__item-title link" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a><div class="doc-columns__item-text"></div></td></tr></table></div><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/tit2/" data-role="toc-anchor" class="toc-anchor"></a><h3 class="main__title-section title toc" toc-anchor="tit2"><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/bssPhr10/"></a><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/dfas0zys9c/" data-dfa="dfas0zys9c"></a>Полезные образцы:</h3><div class="doc-columns doc-columns_type_forms"><table class="" style="width:92%"><tr><td style="vertical-align:top; padding: 0 30px 20px 0;"><div class="doc-columns__item"><span class="media"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41921757/" style="width:"></span><div class="doc-columns__item-title"></div><a class="doc-columns__item-text link npd" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><div class="doc-columns__item"><span class="media"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41921758/" style="width:"></span><div class="doc-columns__item-title"></div><a class="doc-columns__item-text link npd" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a></div></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:top; padding: 0 30px 20px 0;"><div class="doc-columns__item"><span class="media"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41921759/" style="width:"></span><div class="doc-columns__item-title"></div><a class="doc-columns__item-text link npd" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a></div></td><td style="vertical-align:top;"><div class="doc-columns__item"><span class="media"><img class="media__imgage" src="https://1gb.uz/system/content/image/297/1/-41921760/" style="width:"></span><div class="doc-columns__item-title"></div><a class="doc-columns__item-text link npd" href="https://1gb.uz//#/document/"></a></div></td></tr></table></div><a data-anchor="/document/16/221296/tit3/" data-role="toc-anchor" class="toc-anchor"></a><h2 class="main__title-section title toc" toc-anchor="tit3"><a